        }
      }
    },
    "Fiscal keeps this look whatever your device uses." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "O Fiscal mantém este visual, seja qual for o ajuste do aparelho."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fiscal puts the same numbers side by side, in columns of the same width, with no score or ranking." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "O Fiscal põe os mesmos números lado a lado, em colunas da mesma largura, sem nota e sem ranking."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fiscal read names, places and numbers in your question, without AI." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "O Fiscal leu nomes, lugares e números na sua pergunta, sem IA."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fiscal shows only what these bodies publish. When a piece of data is missing, you see a dash, never a zero." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "pt-BR" : {
